);
(b)
"Appointing Authority" means the authority prescribed in sub-regulation (1) of regulation 5;
(c)
"Bank" means Sarva Haryana Gramin Bank established under sub - section (1) of section 3 of the Act;
(d)
"Board" means the Board of Directors of the Bank;
(e)
"Branch Manager" means an officer in charge of the branch of the Bank;
(f)
"Calendar Year" means the period commencing from the 1st day of January of the year and ending with the 31st day of
December of such year;
